					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Hey author, was wondering if you'd allow me to make a tale about this skip?<br /> Late nineties-early two-thousands crap-boxes like these are my specialty and I think more of this skip needs to be, well, existant, it's so fucking hilarious.</p> 
