					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-10315075#post-4161630</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-10315075/scp-2772-j#post-4161630</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 22 Feb 2019 14:43:20 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>H0dari</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>4544962</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>This looks to me like one more joke article in a long line of &quot;non-anomalous thing presented as an anomaly&quot;. There's nothing interesting about this at all, no hook, and no surprises whatsoever.</p> <p>Compared to all other similar joke articles I've seen, this one goes a single step further with the final Director's note. I would've honestly liked this a lot more if the situation would have escalation - like if the item actually *is* anomalous, and compels its owner to try and sell it, and it gets out of hand somehow. But no.</p> <p>The only thing keeping me from giving a -1 is that &quot;in a rage state&quot; line. It's too goddamn funny.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
